      <h2 style={{ fontSize: '30px', lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: '-0.035em', fontWeight: 500, color: '#F5F5F5', marginBottom: '16px' }}>
        Your Business Isn't Broken. It's Leaking — And You Can't See Where.
      </h2>
      <p style={{ fontSize: '14px', lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#8A8A8A', marginBottom: '32px' }}>
        Most founders attempt to fix revenue problems with more ad spend or new agency retainers. The real problem is silent leaks across your funnel architecture.
      </p>

      <div style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '10px' }}>
        {[
          { num: "01", title: "Ad Click Friction", desc: "Traffic lands on generic pages with weak positioning and high drop-off rates." },
          { num: "02", title: "Manual Lead Follow-Up", desc: "Hot leads cool down because your response system takes hours instead of seconds." },
          { num: "03", title: "No Founder Ownership", desc: "Agencies keep you dependent on their team instead of transferring the operating system." }
        ].map((item, idx) => (
          <div key={idx} style={{ backgroundColor: '#080808', border: '1px solid #202020', borderRadius: '3px', padding: '18px' }}>
            <div style={{ fontSize: '11px', color: '#8A8A8A', fontFamily: 'monospace', marginBottom: '6px' }}>LEAK #{item.num}</div>
            <h3 style={{ fontSize: '16px', fontWeight: 500, color: '#F5F5F5', marginBottom: '6px' }}>{item.title}</h3>
            <p style={{ fontSize: '13px', color: '#8A8A8A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{item.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
);

